4. Coding Style Guidelines
Use Tailwind CSS with dark theme (bg-slate-950).
Accent Colors: Math = cyan-400, Physics = violet-400, Chemistry = emerald-400.
Use Framer Motion for gamified card unlocks and radar chart animations.
